    "documentation_evidence": "parse.h documents YAML::Load(const std::string&) as 'Loads the input string as a single YAML document'; docs/Tutorial.md at the same tag shows YAML::Load, Node::Type() and node iteration.",
    "source": "https://github.com/jbeder/yaml-cpp/tree/yaml-cpp-0.9.0",
